<math id="S6.T3.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K=8</annotation></semantics></math> calibration tokens are inserted to each layer.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">7 </span>Additional Qualitative Results</h2>

<div id="S7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide more visual examples of our 3D reconstructions in <a href="#S9.F10" title="In 9 Further Discussions ‣ Fisheye3R: Adapting Unified 3D Feed-Forward Foundation Models to Fisheye Lenses" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, <a href="#S9.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ 9 Further Discussions ‣ Fisheye3R: Adapting Unified 3D Feed-Forward Foundation Models to Fisheye Lenses" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> and <a href="#S9.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ 9 Further Discussions ‣ Fisheye3R: Adapting Unified 3D Feed-Forward Foundation Models to Fisheye Lenses" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>.
In each figure, the first row presents example images from the scenes, while the remaining rows show the ground-truth and predicted point clouds.
The green and red bounding boxes highlight regions where distortions are corrected by calibration tokens most significantly.
These examples demonstrate that calibration tokens consistently improve geometric fidelity of the reconstructions, particularly in areas affected by strong lens distortion or challenging viewing angles.
Camera poses are also estimated more accurately, as reflected by the improved alignment of point maps from different views, especially in extreme settings of FoV and sequence length (<a href="#S9.F12" title="In 9 Further Discussions ‣ Fisheye3R: Adapting Unified 3D Feed-Forward Foundation Models to Fisheye Lenses" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>).</p>
</div>
